pod_gard.lexicon.plant.pod_gard:blue_bellflower=Bellflowers get their name from the distinctive shape of the flowers, which pepper the landscape across §aplains§r, §ameadows§r, and §asunflower plains§r. Their indigo shade makes them a popular ingredient in many §1blue dyes§r.
