pod_gard.lexicon.plant.pod_gard:campion=These flamboyant sentinels of the §aplains§r, §ameadows§r, and §asunflower plains§r are intertwined with myths and mystical phenomena. Both insects and woodland sprites flock to the flower, which blooms a luminescent pink soon after flowering – the perfect source for §dpink dye§r.
pod_gard.lexicon.plant.pod_gard:rose_campion=On one remote island, the Rose Campion is known as the ‘Fairy Flower', and there is a local taboo against picking it from the §2forest§r or §2flower forest§r. This sometimes leads to tension with those who gather the plant for its §4red dye§r.
