pod_gard.lexicon.plant.pod_gard:blue_cape_daisy=While it is known by many names from region to region, the Blue Cape Daisy is universally adored for the simple beauty of its glossy spoon-shaped leaves and delicate flowers. The hardy souls who brave the rigors of the vast emptiness of the §gdesert§r are often charmed by both the sunset romance of the Blue Cape Daisy's rich color and the enchanting §1blue dye§r it produces.
