pod_gard.lexicon.plant.pod_gard:orange_ranunculus=The Ranunculus, better known as a Buttercup, was once seen as a floral paragon of innocence, despite making its home in the §qswamp§r. That changed when a brutal tyrant took to leaving the Ranunculus on the ruins of towns that dared oppose her. As a result, the §6orange dye§r it produces is seen as cursed – and only serves when other dyes are unavailable.
