pod_gard.lexicon.plant.pod_gard:orange_tuberose=The Orange Tuberose is famous for its heady scent, especially when its freshly plucked, and turns its native §2forest§r and §2flower forest§r into a sensory delight. Equally pleasing is its deep hue, which makes a lauded §6orange dye§r.
