pod_gard.lexicon.plant.pod_gard:orange_venus_slipper=The Orange Venus Slipper boasts flowers that resemble the cozy footwear they are named for and have beautifully mottled leaves. The plant can be used to create a bold §6orange dye§r and is found in the §2jungle§r.
