pod_gard.lexicon.plant.pod_gard:orange_verbena=The §qswamp§r-dwelling Orange Verbena usually lives for several years but can succumb to a hard frost, so musicians often compose songs using them a metaphor for lost love. It is an important component of some §6orange dyes§r.
pod_gard.lexicon.plant.pod_gard:pink_verbena=The §qswamp§r-dwelling Pink Verbena usually lives for several years but can succumb to a hard frost, so musicians often compose songs using them a metaphor for lost love. It is an important component of some §dpink dyes§r
