tile.pod_gard:violet.name=Violet
pod_gard.lexicon.plant.pod_gard:violet=Violets are associated with royalty because §5purple dyes§r can be extremely expensive to produce. The Violet's high price means it is still a keenly sought after plant among travelers to the §aplains§r, §ameadows§r, and §asunflower plains§r.
tile.pod_gard:orange_wallflower.name=Orange Wallflower
tile.pod_gard:red_wallflower.name=Red Wallflower
pod_gard.lexicon.plant.pod_gard:orange_wallflower=Often associated with people who are introverted or shy, the Wallflower makes a beautiful §6orange dye§r and is believed to have healing properties. Keep an eye out for it in the §aplains§r, §ameadows§r, and §asunflower plains§r.
pod_gard.lexicon.plant.pod_gard:red_wallflower=Often associated with people who are introverted or shy, the Wallflower makes a beautiful §4red dye§r and is believed to have healing properties. Keep an eye out for it in the §aplains§r, §ameadows§r, and §asunflower plains§r.
tile.pod_gard:red_wall_mushroom.name=Red Wall Mushroom
tile.pod_gard:brown_wall_mushroom.name=Brown Wall Mushroom
pod_gard.lexicon.plant.pod_gard:red_wall_mushroom=Red Wall Mushrooms can be found in §2forests§r growing on logs. They can appear in different variations. When harvested, they will drop a red mushroom, which can now be placed on walls to place the Wall Mushroom variation!
pod_gard.lexicon.plant.pod_gard:brown_wall_mushroom=Brown Wall Mushrooms can be found in §2forests§r growing on logs. They can appear in different variations. When harvested, they will drop a brown mushroom, which can now be placed on walls to place the Wall Mushroom variation!
tile.pod_gard:windflower.name=Windflower
pod_gard.lexicon.plant.pod_gard:windflower=According to mythology, the Windflower was created when a mortal lover was killed and the flower emerged from where her tears fell to the ground in the §2forests§r and §2flower forests§r she ruled over. The §fwhite dye§r it creates is closely associated with romance.
tile.pod_gard:witch_hazel.name=Witch Hazel
pod_gard.lexicon.plant.pod_gard:witch_hazel=As close to pure malevolence as a plant can get, the Witch Hazel is associated with revenge both righteous and petty. It also creates an acrid §eyellow dye§r and can be found in spooky §2forests§r and §2flower forests§r.
tile.pod_gard:white_yarrow.name=White Yarrow
tile.pod_gard:yellow_yarrow.name=Yellow Yarrow
pod_gard.lexicon.plant.pod_gard:white_yarrow=The White Yarrow has a distinctive flat head with small, white flowers on an upright stem. A common sight in §aplains§r, §ameadows§r, and §asunflower plains§r and the source of a rich §fwhite dye§r.
pod_gard.lexicon.plant.pod_gard:yellow_yarrow=The Yellow Yarrow has a distinctive flat head with small, white flowers on an upright stem. A common sight in §aplains§r, §ameadows§r, and §asunflower plains§r and the source of a rich §eyellow dye§r.
tile.pod_gard:yucca.name=Yucca
pod_gard.lexicon.plant.pod_gard:yucca=The tough, fibrous leaves of the §2jungle§r Yucca can be used to create a jade-infused §2green dye§r. The plant is treasured among survivalists because the fibrous leaves can be used to start fires in the wilderness.
