pod_gard.guide.title=GARDENING Add-On
pod_gard.guide.body=§o§7Created by Podcrash
pod_gard.guide.intro=The GARDENING Add-On adds over 290 new plants that will generate naturally into your world. Pick up your Botanical Lexicon and keep track of how many flowers you discover whilst adventuring. Find brand new Cottages, where Gardeners can be found to share and trade exotic and rare flowers. Build your own cottage with 65 new custom flower pots, compatible with both vanilla and custom plants!
pod_gard.guide.book=If you loset the book, you can re-craft it with a book and a §cpoppy§r. You can also access this guide with the command §7/podgard§r at anytime.
