pod_gard.guide.changelog.body=Current Version: §aGARDENING v%1
pod_gard.guide.changelog.subtitle=§lUpdate v%1
pod_gard.guide.changelog.title=Changelog

pod_gard.guide.changelog.1.0.1=- Added Settings Menu\n- Added 'Spawn Moles' Global Setting. When disabled, moles will no longer spawn in the world\n- Added 'Moles create Coarse Dirt' Global Setting. When disabled, moles will no longer create coarse dirt in the world.\n- Added 'Plant Discovery Sound Volume' Player Setting. This can be used to adjust (or mute) the sound played, when the player discovers a new plant.\n- Added Compatibility with Biomes O Plenty\n- Added command "/podgard" to open the Guide Book\n- Added command "/lexicon" to open the Botanical Lexicon\n- Visually overhauled Guide Book\n- Visually overhauled Botanical Lexicon\n- Efficiency now works on Benches, Bird Houses, Picket Fences and Tables when broken with axes\n- Fixed rendering issue with Lotus Lily Pad\n- Fixed Watering Can not working on FARMING crops
pod_gard.guide.changelog.1.0.0=Initial Release


pod_gard.guide.decorations.title=Decorations
pod_gard.guide.decorations.body=This Add-On introduces various new decoration blocks that allow you to enhance your builds! Click one to learn more about it.

pod_gard.guide.decorations.wooden_bench.title=Wooden Benches
pod_gard.guide.decorations.wooden_bench.body=Available in all different wood variants of the base game, the new benches are perfect for creating a nice seating area in your garden. Sit on the bench by pressing :_input_key.use: while looking at it. Need more seating? Simply place another bench next to an existing one, and they will connect to form a larger bench!
pod_gard.guide.decorations.wooden_tables.title=Wooden Tables
pod_gard.guide.decorations.wooden_tables.body=The wooden tables go perfectly along with your new garden benches. Also available in all existing wood variants and expandable by placing another table next to it, this new block is perfect for decoration! 
pod_gard.guide.decorations.wooden_picket_fences.title=Wooden Picket Fences
pod_gard.guide.decorations.wooden_picket_fences.body=Bored of the same old fences? Upgrade your build by replacing them with our new picket fences! Available in all wood variants, picket fences connect to nearby solid blocks, making them perfect for finishing off your garden.
pod_gard.guide.decorations.wooden_bird_houses.title=Wooden Bird Houses
pod_gard.guide.decorations.wooden_bird_houses.body=This new block provides a home for the birds added by this Add-On. At night, birds will look for a nearby bird house and spend the night inside. The bird house is available in all wood variants.
pod_gard.guide.decorations.bird_bath.title=Bird Bath
pod_gard.guide.decorations.bird_bath.body=The bird bath is the perfect finishing touch for any bird sanctuary! Birds will naturally visit it to clean themselves.
pod_gard.guide.decorations.stone_paths.title=Stone Paths
pod_gard.guide.decorations.stone_paths.body=Stone paths can be used to make a solid pathway through your garden. They have multiple variants and can also be rotated to your liking.
pod_gard.guide.decorations.lantern_post.title=Lantern Post
pod_gard.guide.decorations.lantern_post.body=Lantern posts pair perfectly with Minecraft lanterns. When you stack multiple lantern posts on top of each other, they extend upward. Finish the look by placing a lantern on top!
pod_gard.guide.decorations.water_pump.title=Water Pump
pod_gard.guide.decorations.water_pump.body=The water pump is a new way to retrieve water from the depths of your world! Put a bucket, glass bottle or watering can under your water pump by pressing :_input_key.use: on it while holding the specific item. Then press :_input_key.use: on it a few more times to fill it up with water. Once filled, you can press :_input_key.sneak: and :_input_key.use: with an empty hand to take your item with the water inside into your inventory again!
pod_gard.guide.decorations.garden_gnome.title=Garden Gnome
pod_gard.guide.decorations.garden_gnome.body=Garden gnomes will protect your flowers while you sleep at night… or at least they look like they do.
pod_gard.guide.flower_pots.title=Flower Pots
pod_gard.guide.flower_pots.body=This Add-On introduces a total of 65 new flower pots, including unique designs and variations. All flower pots work just like the vanilla flower pot. You can place both flowers from this Add-On and vanilla Minecraft flowers into them. Additionally, GARDENING flowers can also be placed in the vanilla flower pot.
pod_gard.guide.flower_pots.colored.title=Colored Flower Pots
pod_gard.guide.flower_pots.colored.body=You can now turn the vanilla Minecraft flower pot into all 16 color variations! To do this, simply combine the flower pot with a dye to get the colored variant.
pod_gard.guide.flower_pots.wide.title=Colored Wide Flower Pots
pod_gard.guide.flower_pots.wide.body=The wide flower pots are a nice way of decorating your house. Once crafted, you can color it by combining it with one of the 16 dyes. This pot can contain double tall flowers!
pod_gard.guide.flower_pots.tall.title=Colored Tall Flower Pots
pod_gard.guide.flower_pots.tall.body=Just like the wide flower pot, this pot can also contain double tall flowers.
pod_gard.guide.flower_pots.wooden_window_boxes.title=Wooden Window Boxes
pod_gard.guide.flower_pots.wooden_window_boxes.body=Wooden window boxes are available in all types of planks that are in the game. You can put two flowers of the same kind into a window box at the same time.
pod_gard.guide.flower_pots.metal_flower_pot.title=Metal Flower Pot
pod_gard.guide.flower_pots.metal_flower_pot.body=The metal flower pot is a sturdy flower pot that can hold any flower from this Add-On or vanilla Minecraft. You can place double tall flowers in the metal flower pots.
pod_gard.guide.flower_pots.hanging_flower_pot.title=Hanging Flower Pot
pod_gard.guide.flower_pots.hanging_flower_pot.body=This flower pot can be hung from the ceiling for the ultimate vibe in your home!

pod_gard.guide.cottages.title=Cottages
pod_gard.guide.cottages.body=Cottages are structures that can randomly generate within your world in the Forest and Plains biomes. There are 4 different types of cottage, up to 4 additional buildings can generate alongside from a selection of 14 unique structures. The Cottage is home to the §eGardener§r, who loves flowers and plants! Speak to the Gardener to see what plants he is willing to trade with you.

pod_gard.guide.other.title=Other
pod_gard.guide.other.body=There are a bunch more cool features in the GARDENING Add-On that will round off your garden experience!
pod_gard.guide.other.mysterious_seeds.title=Mysterious Seeds
pod_gard.guide.other.mysterious_seeds.body=These seeds can be found by using a brush on grass blocks or from moles that surface. Once obtained, you can plant a mysterious seed either on normal grass or dirt or on farmland, and wait for it to grow. Once grown, any kind of plant can spawn, depending on what block you placed it on. Flowers, saplings, etc. will grow when you place it on normal grass or dirt, while farmland crops will grow whenever you place the mysterious seeds on farmland!
pod_gard.guide.other.lawn_mower.title=Lawn Mower
pod_gard.guide.other.lawn_mower.body=Has your garden gotten out of control? Trim it down with a lawn mower! The lawn mower can be controlled by the player and will break any plants it drives through.
pod_gard.guide.other.watering_can.title=Watering Can
pod_gard.guide.other.watering_can.body=The Watering Can allows you to water plants & crops in your world. You can fill it by clicking on a water source, then use it to water plants.
pod_gard.guide.other.gardener.title=Gardener
pod_gard.guide.other.gardener.body=Gardeners can be found in cottages that spawn around the world. They will be very happy to trade flowers with you and can help you complete your collection!
pod_gard.guide.other.moles.title=Moles
pod_gard.guide.other.moles.body=Moles can be found digging tunnels around your world. If you're lucky, you may be able to catch them above the ground! Sometimes moles can drop mysterious seeds when they surface from the ground.
pod_gard.guide.other.birds.title=Birds
pod_gard.guide.other.birds.body=Birds will spawn throughout your world. Make sure they have a comfortable place to stay at night by building bird houses for them. Bird baths are a favorite hangout, and birds love to play in them during the day!
pod_gard.guide.other.loamy_sand.title=Loamy Sand
pod_gard.guide.other.loamy_sand.body=Loamy sand will appear in patches in deserts. It has just enough nutrients to allow flowers to grow on it, bringing life to your deserts! You can turn loamy sand into bricks by smelting it in a furnace.
pod_gard.guide.item.wooden_slab=Any Wooden Slab
pod_gard.guide.item.wooden_fence=Any Wooden Fence
pod_gard.guide.item.wooden_plank=Any Wooden Plank
pod_gard.guide.item.wooden_log=Any Wooden Log
pod_gard.guide.item.for_stone_path=Any stone type slab\nPlease note, as there is no deepslate slab, you can get four deepslate stone paths by putting a deepslate in your crafting grid.

pod_gard.guide.translate.title=Translate
pod_gard.guide.translate.body=We try to support as many languages as we can. Our Add-On currently supports:\n\n- English\n- French\n- German\n- Indonesian\n- Italian\n- Japanese\n- Korean\n- Polish\n- Portuguese (PT/BR)\n- Spanish (ES/MX)\n\nIf you find an issue, or if we're missing your language, help us improve our translations at §o§shttps://pdcr.sh/translate§r